## 1. chunk.h - Add OP_CONSTANT_LONG

I added OP_CONSTANT_LONG to the existing OpCode enum.

The following shows the combined opcodes used in Chapters 14 and 15.

```c
typedef enum {
  OP_CONSTANT,
  OP_CONSTANT_LONG,
  OP_ADD,
  OP_SUBTRACT,
  OP_MULTIPLY,
  OP_DIVIDE,
  OP_NEGATE,
  OP_RETURN
} OpCode;
```

OP_CONSTANT uses one byte for the constant index.

OP_CONSTANT_LONG uses three bytes for the constant index.

